--[[
How many columns a string occupies.

The formatter breaks lines at a width, and a width in bytes is the wrong
question: a combining mark adds nothing, and a CJK ideograph or an emoji takes
two. This answers in display columns, from the Unicode tables it needs and
nothing else.
]]

